{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender file and interchange formats blender file and interchange formats","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","fileName":"Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender File and Interchange Formats","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 09:04\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Portable 3D Model Data]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Portable 3D Model Data","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender file and interchange formats blender file and interchange formats","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","fileName":"Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender File and Interchange Formats","heading":"Blender File and Interchange Formats","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A `.blend` file preserves a broad Blender project: scenes, meshes, materials, textures, animation, rigs, lights, and other application-specific data. Its binary, comprehensive representation is suited to continued work in Blender but not to human inspection or universal interchange.\n\nInterchange formats intentionally expose a smaller common subset. OBJ, STL, and PLY make different tradeoffs about indices, polygon types, normals, and texture coordinates, yet their limited schemas help other tools agree on transferable geometry. Choosing a format therefore means choosing which aspects of the Blender project must survive the boundary.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Portable 3D Model Data","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender file and interchange formats blender file and interchange formats","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","fileName":"Blender File and Interchange Formats.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender File and Interchange Formats","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[blenderpythonapi.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Portable 3D Model Data","blenderpythonapi.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}